## Session Context (Universal Actuator MCP)

Federation gateway that consolidates 15+ MCP servers into a single tool interface with RAG and agentic workflows.

**Before starting work:**
1. Check hub status: `universal_status()` — federation graph, registered domains
2. Search federated content: `search_federated(query="...", sources=["calibre","knowledge"])`

**At end of work:**
- Record progress with `universal_milestone(title="...", description="...")`
- Ingest new content to RAG if relevant: `ingest_fleet_to_rag(source="...")`
